    "detailed_description": "\u300aDream\u300bis a game that includes exploration and decryption.<br />\r\nThe astronaut is lost in outer space, he wants to return home, all the confusing scenes, is this a dream or another world?<br />\r\nIn psychedelic scene you need to discover and explore objects that can interactive with each other, and try to move to the next level.<br />\r\nAvoid dangerous traps,avoid falling injury......<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPay attention to you oxygen value, without oxygen will reduce health.<br />\r\nWhen you have oxygen will restore health.<br />\r\nHint: you can stay at oxygen area for think deeply, or quickly explore location places.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter purchasing, you will receive a complete experience without any internal purchases.<br />\r\nThe game lasts about 1.5 hours.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAuthor: DreamRZ<br />\r\nE-mail: DreamRL@live.com",
